{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_05",
  "title": "會飲圖",
  "storyCode": "DT-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "be877b49b05d1ad5afc4cd3a90067d12d2e9b4d55bb4f6df64dfb9721b9575bc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我跟著法琳走進了那座山洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "在那裡，我才知道，她的秘訣究竟是什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "而且，她還告訴了我所謂的“生態”是什麼，在那一刻，我才第一次知道自己原來是那麼地缺乏實踐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "也是在那一天，我和法琳成了好朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "人生得一知己，夫復何求？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "這位法琳妹妹，對你來說一定很重要吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯，她是我最好的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "那麼，你不應該去找她嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我記得你說過，她被炎龍吃掉了，但是，你們有辦法復活她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "炎龍……炎龍……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們會去的，到時候，我會把她帶來婆山鎮見一見你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "咦，今天來得似乎有點頻繁了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……該不會是萊歐斯那傢伙捅了什麼婁子吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "唉，我能做的……也只有這麼多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "萊歐斯小哥，看來你的夥伴們，只能靠你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "怎麼了，瑪露希爾妹妹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "怪了，明明鐘聲響了，但是，卻沒有墨魎來襲擊鎮子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "萊歐斯也沒有回來……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哼哼，喜歡吃杏子的話，那就跑起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊歐斯說著，把採來的一把杏子往遠處一丟，只見一群大大小小的獸形墨魎都朝著杏子跑去。\n看著牠們搶杏子的畫面，萊歐斯開心極了，他幾乎要把這群傢伙當成自己家裡養的狗了。\n對，簡直就和奴莎、亞諾特里德、波夫、福奇、抹布和木木一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "呆呆的墨魎",
      "text": "嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "別急，你們也有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "對於這種有點像樹懶的墨魎，萊歐斯當然不會選擇讓牠們爭搶。\n他已經摸清楚了這種墨魎的喜好，特地摘了一堆水果，堆在那裡讓牠們放肆地吃。\n牠們吃飽了就會躺下，背上的顏色也會變……\n看著牠們挺著圓滾滾的肚子還要奮力往嘴裡塞果子的樣子，萊歐斯很好奇，真的會有人不喜歡這群小傢伙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠哉的墨魎",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "放心，我怎麼會忘了你們呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "烏龜一樣的墨魎可以說是萊歐斯現在最好奇的墨魎了，一開始，他還以為牠們是一大塊石頭，直到自己一屁股坐了上去。\n這種墨魎的個性和烏龜如出一轍，而最有趣的是，如果你讓牠們吃飽了，牠們背上的假山會流下泉水——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠處雷聲隆隆。\n墨魎們聽到雷聲，紛紛想要站起來。\n可是，牠們發現自己站不起來……原因很簡單——\n牠們吃得太飽了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "看來今年的收成會很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "多虧了你啊，先西老爺子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "要是沒有你，我看這收成至少得少一半！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫也只是把自己知道的知識運用起來罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "先西，別種田了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "萊歐斯自從上次跑去鎮外找墨魎後，好幾天沒回來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "萊歐斯？他喜歡研究，就讓他去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "而且，最近墨魎都沒有來攻擊鎮子了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "他會不會出事了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "嗯……反正我們要在這裡待很久，不妨再等一等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不，不對……我們不能在這裡待很久！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們要一起去打敗炎龍、救出法琳的啊，你忘了嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，說到這裡，我們在這座鎮子裡待多久了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎們",
      "text": "嘎——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你們又餓了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哼哼，真是群貪心的傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "放心，今天也少不了你們的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "不過，今天我們要來做一件不一樣的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "呆呆的墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嘎——嘎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歡快的墨魎",
      "text": "嗚嘎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠哉的墨魎",
      "text": "啊——呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "看到那邊的山頂了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我在那裡放了許多你們最愛的果子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "要是想吃的話，就要靠自己的力量去爭取！這是自然界的鐵則！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎們",
      "text": "嘎嘎嘎——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "明白了的話，那麼，三、二、一——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "跑起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隨著萊歐斯的話音落下，墨魎們爭先恐後地向著山頂方向跑了起來——除了烏龜形的墨魎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠哉的墨魎",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯？你這是想要讓我坐上去嗎？你願意馱著我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哈哈，真聰明，知道與其和牠們搶，不如討好我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠哉的墨魎",
      "text": "呼——啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "好好好，都有份，都有份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山中無日月。\n萊歐斯已經明白，雷聲會引得墨魎們下山去攻擊鎮子。\n但這件事並不是絕對的，墨魎們的習性並不會因此被抹去。\n那麼，為什麼不讓墨魎們盡可能遠離鎮子呢？\n這就是他正在做的事，從山頂跑到山腳，可比從山腰跑下去遠多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "呼……嗝……這酒真不錯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "您就說，服不服吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "不……不服！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "那就再來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "奇爾查克！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "嗯？瑪露希爾，你怎麼來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "別喝了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "萊歐斯已經不知道多久沒回來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "最近墨魎們也幾乎不再進攻了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "一定是他做了什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "那就讓他做去吧，我要喝酒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "果然，奇爾查克的狀況和我們之前完全一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯，他幾乎要把自己當成鎮子裡的一員了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……奇爾查克，你還記得我們來到這座鎮子多久了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你還記得我們的目的是救出法琳嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你還記得你最討厭寶箱怪嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……嘶，呃，我的頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你也反應過來了嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "奇爾查克，你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘎嘎嘎，嘎？（所以你們都叫什麼？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "呆呆的墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歡快的墨魎",
      "text": "嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠哉的墨魎",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘎嘎嘎嗚！萊歐斯！（原來如此，你們的名字分別是，阿咬、小躁，還有偷閒？我叫萊歐斯！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿咬",
      "text": "嗚嗚嘎，嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小躁",
      "text": "嘎嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷閒",
      "text": "呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘎嘎唔嘎嗚嘎嘎！（嗯，我們當然是好朋友！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寒盡不知年。\n萊歐斯已經不在乎雷聲是否響起了。\n如今，他已經和這群墨魎成為好朋友，他們同吃同住，每天一起摘果子，一起在山林裡奔跑嬉戲。\n他甚至能聽懂牠們在說些什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "你確定萊歐斯在這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我不知道……但是，墨魎們應該就是從這個方向來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "如果萊歐斯一直在研究牠們的話，我猜他一定會在這裡……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "如果按你說的，自從他來了這裡以後，墨魎們的進攻就變得少了許多……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "難道說，是他做了什麼事阻止了墨魎的攻擊……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "不過我總覺得，他可能只是跑去和那些墨魎不知道玩什麼去了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯……還是快點先找到他究竟在哪裡吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊歐斯跟牠們一起生活得越是久，越是理解這種名為“墨魎”的“生物”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……該回去告訴其他人這個事實了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "他們大概會很驚訝吧，畢竟——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿咬",
      "text": "嘎嘎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘎嘎哦！（跟我一起來吧，我要介紹一下我的幾個同伴給你們。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小躁",
      "text": "嗚嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗚嗚嘎嘎！（放心，他們都是好人，不會傷害你們的——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷閒",
      "text": "嗚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘎——嘎——（嗯，他們一定也會喜歡你的！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊歐斯，我們來幫……\n……你\n……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在救夥伴心切的三人看來，極端詭異的一幕出現了。\n他們著急尋找的萊歐斯——\n此時正四肢著地，像是野生動物一樣趴在地上，用他們根本無法理解的語言和墨魎們交流著。\n他們感覺到，心裡有某種東西碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗚嘎嘎！（啊，你們來得剛好耶！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "噢，不好意思，用牠們的語言久了，差點不會說人話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……對不起，是我們打擾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "欸，你們別走啊，我有很重要的發現要告訴你們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不不不，我們就不打擾您在這裡享福了，我們會自己尋找離開的方法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我要告訴你們的，就和離開的方法有關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你們看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "朋友們，開飯了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎們",
      "text": "嘎——！（快活地跑向各種水果）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這、這……你用這些水果馴服了墨魎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿咬",
      "text": "嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "牠怎麼變色了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這就是牠的特性，阿咬吃飽了會變色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "牠叫阿咬？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯，那個小狗一樣的墨魎叫小躁，烏龜一樣的叫偷閒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你取的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "牠們告訴我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿咬",
      "text": "嘎嘎——嘔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗚哇，不僅是餵飽了，這隻吃太多都吐了！而且吐出來的顏色好鮮豔，有點噁心——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……嗯？好熟悉的……酒香……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "先西，你在幹嘛！那可是魔物吐出來的東西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "是果酒的味道，嗯……聞起來發酵得很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……吃起來味道也不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不要亂吃東西啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "別急，你們聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "聽什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "肚子裡晃晃蕩蕩的聲音。這個裡面是酒，這個裡面像是果醬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "所以呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "再來看這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "牠吃了果子之後背上的假山也開始有泉水流動了，嗯……這些滲出來的東西，唔哦，好清爽的口感，是果汁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "可是這和離開這裡有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "等一下你就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "先西，你有帶能裝果醬和飲料的容器嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "我有，最近每天要和鎮裡人喝酒，搞得我隨身帶了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "別告訴我你們想……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "別告訴我你們要……！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "很好，不過這些果醬人吃的話還是要加一點糖調味才可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "這些果汁的話……雖然味道都很清爽，但是口感還是有點單調。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "可以像這樣，把適合搭配在一起的果汁混合起來……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "也加入一些糖調味，攪拌均勻……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……最後用玻璃瓶盛起來，放上點水果點綴——好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "都來吃看看吧，老夫改良後的墨魎果酒、果醬和果汁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "嗯~這果酒還真的是別有一番風味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "但是糖的攝入量肯定超標了，今天要多做一點事消耗掉才好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……我不想和你們這些會吃嘔吐物的人說話……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "蜂蜜其實就是蜜蜂的嘔吐物喔，瑪露希爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "魔像背上的蔬菜也是由迷宮中人們的排泄物澆灌——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊——我不聽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "萊歐斯，你怎麼了？從剛才開始你就一言不發的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "接下來，我想說說我的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我追著那隻長了痣的墨魎去了鎮子外面，卻發現牠們居然能停下攻擊然後開開心心地偷吃水果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "什麼意思……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "魔物會襲擊人類，雖然有的時候是出於天生的攻擊性……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "但是大部分時候還有更確切的原因，比如領地受到侵犯，或者因為一些事情被激怒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "就算是因為飢餓而襲擊鎮子，牠們進食的狀態也不會像現在這樣溫和。你看牠們，一副溫順親人的模樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小躁",
      "text": "嘎汪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……還流了滿地的口水，濕答答的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "然後，鎮裡人對於墨魎的習性毫不了解其實也非常奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我們才來沒多久就發現了餵水果這個方法，但鎮民們和墨魎這麼頻繁地接觸，就算是不想做，最後也應該迫不得已地去瞭解並制定對策。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "但是鎮裡人卻沒有這麼做，就好像這麼做沒有必要一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "有可能他們試過了，但是沒學會？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那就更奇怪了，他們既沒有搬離這個會被騷擾的、不適合生活的地方，也沒有學會我們使用的這種攻擊方式……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "他們是怎麼在這裡一直生活下去的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你們發現了嗎？墨魎們甚至沒有被我們找到一個“窩”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "而且，牠們還會不斷地死而復生，就好像……這裡的一切都是“假的”一樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……嗯，有趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "黎小姐？你是什麼時候……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "願聞其詳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……在我們來的地方，傳說是一個叫“狂亂魔法師”的傢伙，用自己龐大的魔力創造了迷宮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "在那座迷宮裡，存在著各式各樣的魔物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "但那些魔物並不是孤立的，牠們會互相影響，有的互相捕食，有的互相利用，有的互相依賴共生——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "大家都平等地處於同一個生態圈中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "無論狂亂魔法師是個什麼樣的人，能做到這一點，我認為都是非常了不起的。而這裡……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我覺得，能夠製造這樣一個栩栩如生的世界的人，一定也是個非常厲害的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "但是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿咬",
      "text": "（吧唧著嘴流口水）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我在想……那個人既然創造了這些墨魎，又為什麼沒有為牠們設計一套更加完整的生態系統？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "牠們的窩長什麼樣？怎樣繁衍？不同樣貌的墨魎之間是怎麼交流的？又和這裡的人有怎樣的關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我真的非常好奇，但一直都沒有看到。那個人究竟為什麼要設計這些？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "而且，我還發現了這個……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "牠們藏起了一筐山楂，卻一直沒有吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……山楂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "（小聲）山楂……嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "（小聲）……我都沒有發現呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "沒什麼，一點自言自語罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "只是……原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你所在意的事物之間的勾連，彼此互證，你我皆為對方的鏡子，對你來說，這才是你理解的“真”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，為什麼老夫完全沒聽懂他們兩個人的對話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "唔……嗯……雖然我也很想這樣說，但是總覺得又有點聽懂了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……噗哈哈哈，有意思，有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "是了，天地萬物皆有其理，畫中亦有眾生百態，墨魎當然也該有其來處，有其去處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "既然墨魎只是無根浮萍，則破綻自現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "古往今來，不是沒有人因此發現此間不過畫中境，但是……如此篤定的發言倒是很久沒有聽過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "這何嘗不是一種“看山還是山，看水還是水”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說著，黎不知為何轉身，看向天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "這也算是參破了此間之妙吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這幅畫怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "原本畫的明明是山水，怎麼變成了這個樣子……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這腌臢墨團，這水漬，這紅紫斑駁……誰來過我的房間？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "難道是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，這次倒不是我那“好姐姐”……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有意思，是荒野上的精怪的手筆嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哇！怎麼突然打這麼大的雷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "哎呀呀，看來是真的生氣了呢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "什麼？誰？誰生氣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "怪不得，這麼多墨魎都被吸引過來了，還醉得歪七扭八，這副樣子也是第一次見呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "黎小姐，你在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你們看！天上掉下來了一個人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "唔……不像是掉下來的，像是飛過來的……看起來有點生氣，是創造這裡的魔法師嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊，一定是萊歐斯口無遮攔惹怒了她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "啊？我也沒說什麼啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "別怕，這只是有點特別的……送客之道，並不是要置你們於死地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "墨魎畢竟只是她的雜念，既然是雜念，她不願好好安置也算情有可原。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "欸！你輕一點，牠們剛剛吃飽，不能這樣倒著提起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿咬",
      "text": "嘎嘔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "趕快拿瓶子裝起來，不能浪費了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "都給我——出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "啊啊、啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你怎麼拿著劍畫——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "畫啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "——啊！我的屁股！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們怎麼……你們還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "咳咳咳……我在這，我沒事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫也沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "這裡……能聞到海的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "我們來到海邊了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "不知道，但至少，我們應該是離開那裡了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "不對，等等，我還沒來得及和牠們道別呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "結果還是靠萊歐斯對魔物的愛來解決的啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "等等，瑪露希爾，你的嘴上……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你嘴上怎麼黑黑的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你其實最後還是沒忍住也吃了，對不對！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯嗯？……不對啊，你們也是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "噗呸呸呸！這是什麼味道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們剛剛這是吃了什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "……這幅畫是不能要了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我倒覺得他們很有趣……你不嚐嚐嗎？還有這些山楂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "嚐一口唄？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "……不吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
